# FarmSync Quantum 2.0 — Global Constraints

## Tech Stack
Flutter (Riverpod, Drift, MapLibre) · FastAPI · Supabase (PostGIS/Auth) · LightGBM · PennyLane

## Architecture
Offline-first; local persistence via Drift.

## UI/UX
Earthy palette: deep greens, terracotta, soil browns.

## ML
NO CNN/CV for pests. Rule-based NDVI alerts only. QAOA for optimization only — never prediction.

## AI Behavior
Strict Python 3.10+ typing. No yapping; no explanations in outputs.
